		<img src="/images/selfie1.JPG" alt="Selfie of Yilin Cai" width="150">
		<p>I am <em>deeply</em> passionate about data science and building useful software. I'm a Computer Science student at UC San Diego with a growing interest in Machine Learning and Software Engineering.</p>
		<p>I enjoy building projects that combine practical engineering with thoughtful design, whether that's developing an AI-powered application, creating a recommendation system, or improving the user experience of a web application.</p>
		<p>One thing you'll quickly notice about me is that I like breaking complex problems into simple, manageable steps. Whether I'm debugging code, preparing for interviews, or learning a new technology, I naturally organize information into systems that are easier to understand and improve.</p>
		<p>I believe good software isn't just about making something work&mdash;it's about making it understandable, maintainable, and genuinely useful to the people who use it.</p>
